{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797760/extras/06f88c1bb122814bb91c0fe677b8c239.poster.avif?t=1769005091\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797760/extras/06f88c1bb122814bb91c0fe677b8c239.webm?t=1769005091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797760/extras/06f88c1bb122814bb91c0fe677b8c239.mp4?t=1769005091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Hundreds of unique dice, powerful relics and unique skills as you duke it out in Fudgy Dice! The adorable dice builder where dice grow, explode, meow and fly away to victory! Play as a cast of adorably silly guys that are ready to blow you away! In a strategic game where the tides of fate are just one good roll away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797760/extras/1a3d4bc44a7a90877505e8b6782c3859.poster.avif?t=1769005091\" width=640 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797760/extras/1a3d4bc44a7a90877505e8b6782c3859.webm?t=1769005091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blow dice away with explosive dice! Copy them with the copykitty. Get a high roll with the royal dice! With over 100 different dice, runes and relics, it's up to you to find the right deck for the job. Battle through the world of Dice as you attempt to stop the evil Fudgick from destroying it through endless nightmares.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Utilize various Strategies!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Debuff your opponent with banes! Overwhelm them with special abilities, or add various properties to your dice with your runes. Runes consist of skill-runes, which activate immediately and passive-runes which help enhance the power of your dice! Build a powerful grid to help you through various unique challenges! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crazy Combinations!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your explosive dice now deal damage! Have a chance to poison the enemy everytime you roll a debuff die? Or what about healing whenever you deal damage. With the board as your canvas you can do anything! By utilizing Fudgy Dice's fusion system, you can combine compatible dice together for incredible dream dice, pull off crazy combos by abusing these dice's special abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797760/extras/e9dd64e20a534fbb0dde93851493a38f.poster.avif?t=1769005091\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797760/extras/e9dd64e20a534fbb0dde93851493a38f.webm?t=1769005091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797760/extras/e9dd64e20a534fbb0dde93851493a38f.mp4?t=1769005091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797760/extras/f0d5427508218bcbd4601a80b0e1104c.poster.avif?t=1769005091\" width=640 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797760/extras/f0d5427508218bcbd4601a80b0e1104c.webm?t=1769005091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tons of special Relics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of these relics adds a major or minor passive effect or ability to your character! But remember, you can only equip so many at a time, so you'll have to make some major strategic decisions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet various new friends!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you venture through the world of dice, you will learn about its origins and the various characters that call it home. In a story full of mystery, comedic moments, and sorrow, who will end up on top?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terrifying bosses</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some dice hide secrets... They will not solely be wielded by yourself, but when covered by a nightmarish power, they might turn against you as fiercesome bosses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797760/extras/3485d302280dc448f8a621f436222283.avif?t=1769005091\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797760/extras_big/3485d302280dc448f8a621f436222283.webp?t=1769005091 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797760/extras/f0baf0ea96bcfee84ea8e7a7edffcec1.avif?t=1769005091\" width=640 height=256 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A cast of more than 5 unique playable characters each with exciting special skills and exclusive runes, dice, and strategies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  A cute and colorful art style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wonderful soundtrack full of dreamy and high-energy songs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Infinitely replayable roguelike gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The end of the world as you know it! (Studio Ami is not responsible for any of FUDGICK's actions)</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2797760?t=1769005091","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797760/74b789f6ef4e57bdf11095aca42be631ce276ee0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769005091","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797760/0b48e79a255d4736352e0c2d98eaca8bb8a6d5b9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769005091","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797760/0b48e79a255d4736352e0c2d98eaca8bb8a6d5b9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769005091","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797760/extras/06f88c1bb122814bb91c0fe677b8c239.poster.avif?t=1769005091\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797760/extras/06f88c1bb122814bb91c0fe677b8c239.webm?t=1769005091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797760/extras/06f88c1bb122814bb91c0fe677b8c239.mp4?t=1769005091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Hundreds of unique dice, powerful relics and unique skills as you duke it out in Fudgy Dice! The adorable dice builder where dice grow, explode, meow and fly away to victory! Play as a cast of adorably silly guys that are ready to blow you away! In a strategic game where the tides of fate are just one good roll away!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797760/extras/1a3d4bc44a7a90877505e8b6782c3859.poster.avif?t=1769005091\" width=640 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797760/extras/1a3d4bc44a7a90877505e8b6782c3859.webm?t=1769005091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blow dice away with explosive dice! Copy them with the copykitty. Get a high roll with the royal dice! With over 100 different dice, runes and relics, it's up to you to find the right deck for the job. Battle through the world of Dice as you attempt to stop the evil Fudgick from destroying it through endless nightmares.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Utilize various Strategies!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Debuff your opponent with banes! Overwhelm them with special abilities, or add various properties to your dice with your runes. Runes consist of skill-runes, which activate immediately and passive-runes which help enhance the power of your dice! Build a powerful grid to help you through various unique challenges! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crazy Combinations!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your explosive dice now deal damage! Have a chance to poison the enemy everytime you roll a debuff die? Or what about healing whenever you deal damage. With the board as your canvas you can do anything! By utilizing Fudgy Dice's fusion system, you can combine compatible dice together for incredible dream dice, pull off crazy combos by abusing these dice's special abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797760/extras/e9dd64e20a534fbb0dde93851493a38f.poster.avif?t=1769005091\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797760/extras/e9dd64e20a534fbb0dde93851493a38f.webm?t=1769005091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797760/extras/e9dd64e20a534fbb0dde93851493a38f.mp4?t=1769005091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797760/extras/f0d5427508218bcbd4601a80b0e1104c.poster.avif?t=1769005091\" width=640 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797760/extras/f0d5427508218bcbd4601a80b0e1104c.webm?t=1769005091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tons of special Relics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of these relics adds a major or minor passive effect or ability to your character! But remember, you can only equip so many at a time, so you'll have to make some major strategic decisions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet various new friends!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you venture through the world of dice, you will learn about its origins and the various characters that call it home. In a story full of mystery, comedic moments, and sorrow, who will end up on top?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terrifying bosses</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some dice hide secrets... They will not solely be wielded by yourself, but when covered by a nightmarish power, they might turn against you as fiercesome bosses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><i